:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0543em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.656em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.384em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9384em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.9384em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.344em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4169em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1514em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观测到的正面比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是总数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = z_{\\alpha/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7858em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标准正态分布的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 分位数；取减号得下界，取加号得上界。置信度 0.95 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = 1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>，更高置信度（如 0.975）对应更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 与更保守的下界。无样本的条目分数可置零。\n关键性质是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很小时，下界被显著拉低；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 增大时，区间收窄并趋近观测均值。这恰好把&quot;证据不足&quot;编码进了排序值本身，不需要另设规则。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二值化与自己的-正面-定义\">二值化与自己的&quot;正面&quot;定义</h3><p>Wilson 下界要求把评价化为伯努利观测，但晒单的&quot;正面&quot;不是单一维度。合理的做法是按<strong>用途</strong>定义不同的伯努利事件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>正面事件定义</th>\n<th>排序反映的是</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认排序</td>\n<td>有互动且未被打低分</td>\n<td>综合有用性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;最有帮助&quot;</td>\n<td>被点&quot;有用&quot;</td>\n<td>信息帮助度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;最新&quot;</td>\n<td>不做平滑，按时间</td>\n<td>时效性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带货位</td>\n<td>曝光后有加购</td>\n<td>转化贡献</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把四个用途压成一个分数是最常见的错误——同一批内容在不同用途下的最优排序完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"多信号平滑\">多信号平滑</h3><p>互动信号不只&quot;有用&quot;一种，因此需要把多个信号合成为一个标量再套 Wilson。合成方式应当是可解释的加权，并对每个信号施加贝叶斯平滑（向类目先验收缩），避免小类目里的偶然高值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} = \\frac{s + \\alpha_0}{n + \\alpha_0 + \\beta_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是正面事件数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_0, \\beta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是先验参数。先验应随类目不同（高频类目先验更强），而不是全局一个常数。</p>\n<p>先验的选择并不神秘：它等价于&quot;在没有任何数据之前，我们预期这个类目的正面率是多少、这个预期相当于多少条样本&quot;。对晒单这类互动稀疏的场景，常见做法是把同类目已积累内容的整体正面率作为先验均值，把置信强度设为&quot;等价于约 10 条观测&quot;。直接好处是<strong>新内容不会因 0 条互动被判为最差</strong>，而是从类目基线出发随自身数据逐步偏离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折叠与降权的分级\">折叠与降权的分级</h2><h3 id=\"折叠不是删除\">折叠不是删除</h3><p>&quot;折叠&quot;指内容默认收起、需要点击才展开。它和&quot;不展示&quot;是两种不同的处置，用途完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>对创作者</th>\n<th>对读者</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常展示</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n<td>可见</td>\n<td>绝大多数内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折叠</td>\n<td>可见，且能得知被折叠</td>\n<td>默认收起</td>\n<td>质量偏低但合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降权</td>\n<td>不告知具体原因</td>\n<td>位置靠后</td>\n<td>疑似低质或轻微风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅自己可见</td>\n<td>可见，被告知受限</td>\n<td>不可见</td>\n<td>违规但情节轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不展示</td>\n<td>被告知驳回理由</td>\n<td>不可见</td>\n<td>明确违规</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>折叠的价值在于它是<strong>可逆且低伤害</strong>的处置：创作者仍能看到自己的内容在架上，读者仍能主动查看，平台不需要为误判承担&quot;内容消失&quot;的指责。对&quot;质量低但无违规&quot;这一大类内容——模糊的视频、无信息量的文字、重复内容——折叠是比降权或删除更合适的档位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"折叠判定的信号\">折叠判定的信号</h3><p>质量排序的输入信号应当能被拆解与复核：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;reviewId&quot;: &quot;r_8f21c&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rank&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;primary&quot;: &quot;usefulness&quot;,&#10;    &quot;wilsonLowerBound&quot;: 0.412,&#10;    &quot;inputs&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;n_impressions&quot;: 1840,&#10;      &quot;n_useful&quot;: 41,&#10;      &quot;n_not_useful&quot;: 9,&#10;      &quot;prior&quot;: { &quot;alpha0&quot;: 8, &quot;beta0&quot;: 2, &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;category_apparel&quot; },&#10;      &quot;riskPenalty&quot;: 0.0,&#10;      &quot;dupPenalty&quot;: 0.05,&#10;      &quot;recencyDecay&quot;: 0.97&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;collapse&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;collapsed&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;reasons&quot;: [&quot;low_media_quality&quot;, &quot;short_text_no_info&quot;],&#10;      &quot;reversible&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;reviewAfterDays&quot;: 7&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"r_8f21c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rank\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"usefulness\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"wilsonLowerBound\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.412</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"n_impressions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1840</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"n_useful\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"n_not_useful\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"prior\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alpha0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"beta0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_apparel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"riskPenalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dupPenalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recencyDecay\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.97</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"collapse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"collapsed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reasons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"low_media_quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"short_text_no_info\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reversible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reviewAfterDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reasons</code> 与 <code>reviewAfterDays</code> 是必须的：可逆处置若没有复议时点，会变成事实上的永久惩罚。折叠判定的阈值也应随类目分布调整，而不是全局统一——高频类目里的&quot;低互动&quot;和低频类目的&quot;低互动&quot;含义完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免-折叠黑洞\">避免&quot;折叠黑洞&quot;</h3><p>折叠有一个典型退化路径：被折叠的内容获得曝光更少，因此互动更少，因此更难脱离折叠状态。这会让早期被误折叠的优质内容永久沉底。</p>\n<p>对冲方式有两种：一是给折叠内容保留<strong>固定比例的探索曝光</strong>（与推荐系统的探索预算同理，见 <a href=\"../ugc-incentive-distribute/ugc-distribute-pdp-feed\">晒单在商详/搜索/Feed 分发</a>）；二是设置<strong>强制复议</strong>时点，到期后即使没有新互动也重新评估一次。第二种在小流量商品上尤其重要——那些商品可能永远等不到足够的曝光来自然翻盘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序与治理的相互约束\">排序与治理的相互约束</h2><h3 id=\"排序不得与合规判定冲突\">排序不得与合规判定冲突</h3><p>排序只能在其输入都是合规内容的前提下工作。若一条内容被判违规，它不应通过&quot;高互动&quot;重新排到前面——<strong>合规是硬门槛，排在排序之前</strong>。这类内容应在进入候选集之前被过滤，而不是在排序时被降权。</p>\n<p>同样地，风险分应作为<strong>乘性惩罚</strong>而非加性项：加性项在互动量极大时会被淹没，而乘性惩罚保证任何风险等级都能有效压低排序，无论内容多受欢迎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"排序反馈的自我强化\">排序反馈的自我强化</h3><p>互动信号驱动的排序会形成反馈环：排前面的内容获得更多互动，互动又巩固其排名。这个环本身是合理的（说明它确实被用户接受），但会在两种情况下变成问题：一是<strong>位置偏差</strong>被当作质量（高位内容天然获得更多点击），二是<strong>同质化</strong>（系统只推一种风格，其他风格永远得不到验证）。</p>\n<p>对位置偏差的校正要求在记录互动时必须带上坑位序号，并在训练或计算时按位置做归一。对同质化的对冲是多样性约束，它与信息去重是同一套机制的两个用法（见 <a href=\"../ugc-incentive-distribute/ugc-distribute-pdp-feed\">晒单在商详/搜索/Feed 分发</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间衰减与-长期霸屏\">时间衰减与&quot;长期霸屏&quot;</h3><p>不设时间衰减时，最早的高互动内容会永久占据前排，后续优质内容无法浮现。衰减系数应温和——过快会让内容刚积累起互动就被新内容顶掉，削弱创作动力。合理形态是<strong>分段衰减</strong>：前 30 天保持全权重（内容正在被需要），之后缓慢线性衰减到某个下限（不归零，因为经典内容仍有参考价值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>排序的核心困难是稀疏样本下的质量估计，不是&quot;把好的排前面&quot;。</li>\n<li>用 Wilson 分数下界替代均值排序；下界把证据强度编码进排序值，置信度 0.95 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>不同用途需要不同的伯努利事件定义，把多用途压成一个分数会同时降低所有用途的效果。</li>\n<li>多信号合成前先做贝叶斯平滑，先验随类目不同。</li>\n<li>折叠是可逆低伤害的处置，适用于&quot;低质但合规&quot;这一大类；必须带 <code>reasons</code> 与复议时点。</li>\n<li>折叠有&quot;黑洞&quot;退化路径，需探索曝光或强制复议对冲。</li>\n<li>合规是排序之前的硬门槛；风险分应为乘性惩罚而非加性项。</li>\n<li>互动排序有自我强化环，需位置偏差校正与多样性约束。</li>\n<li>时间衰减应温和且分段，避免长期霸屏与更新过快的两个极端。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>质量分的构成与新颖度度量见 <a href=\"../ugc-incentive-distribute/quality-ugc-incentive\">优质晒单激励与买家秀</a>；位置偏差校正与曝光回写见 <a href=\"../ugc-incentive-distribute/ugc-distribute-pdp-feed\">晒单在商详/搜索/Feed 分发</a>；折叠率等指标如何进入看板见 <a href=\"video-review-coverage-metric\">视频晒单覆盖率与效果看板</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"晒单质量排序与折叠","id":"晒单质量排序与折叠"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏条件下的质量估计","id":"稀疏条件下的质量估计"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么不按平均分排序","id":"为什么不按平均分排序"},{"level":3,"text":"二值化与自己的\"正面\"定义","id":"二值化与自己的-正面-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"多信号平滑","id":"多信号平滑"},{"level":2,"text":"折叠与降权的分级","id":"折叠与降权的分级"},{"level":3,"text":"折叠不是删除","id":"折叠不是删除"},{"level":3,"text":"折叠判定的信号","id":"折叠判定的信号"},{"level":3,"text":"避免\"折叠黑洞\"","id":"避免-折叠黑洞"},{"level":2,"text":"排序与治理的相互约束","id":"排序与治理的相互约束"},{"level":3,"text":"排序不得与合规判定冲突","id":"排序不得与合规判定冲突"},{"level":3,"text":"排序反馈的自我强化","id":"排序反馈的自我强化"},{"level":3,"text":"时间衰减与\"长期霸屏\"","id":"时间衰减与-长期霸屏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"晒单版权与使用授权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/video-review-ugc-content-ops/video-ugc-governance/video-ugc-rights-license"},"next":{"title":"视频晒单覆盖率与效果看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/video-review-ugc-content-ops/video-ugc-governance/video-review-coverage-metric"}}